{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント大切に読みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか皆様が健康で美味しいご飯を食べて毎日笑顔でいれますように..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は沢山オウチのお掃除をしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は一段落してハーブティーを飲みながらblogを書いてるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←オッシャレーィッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今日の晩御飯は\n『和風ハンバーグ』\nだよーんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんといると\nケラケラケラケラずーーーっと\n笑ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん天然だからめちゃくちゃ面白い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の撮影の時、オシリ掴んできた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？\nうん！多分せっちゃんだった...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでもオシリといえば..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんを想像した方も何人かいるだろう......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、まいやんちゃんもなかなかオシリ好きなんだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかそう考えると乃木坂はオシリ好き多いなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は師匠のかずみんがとってくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず仲良しです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも気にかけてくれてありがたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても頼りになるし、ホッとするし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の大切なお姉ちゃんなんだ〜!!笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは何人姉妹だろう♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑\n大好きなお姉ちゃんが沢山\n乃木坂にはいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか面と向かっては言えないんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今日はブログを通じて伝えちゃお〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくしてくれて、相談にのってくれて、アドバイスしてくれて、かまってくれて、そばにいてくれて、\n本当に大切なお姉ちゃん達です\nいつもありがとう...照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか恥ずかしくなってきたので、この辺で終わりです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは兄弟、姉妹？\nそれとも一人っ子？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、まあやはお兄ちゃんがいるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...沢山...笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってお兄ちゃんになりたいって、コメントに書いてあったも〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/01/9381946/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}